# ============================================================
# BR-021 Binance REST client
# ============================================================

### Get latest BTCUSDT 4h klines from Binance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/binance/market-data/klines?symbol=BTCUSDT&interval=4h&limit=5


### Get BTCUSDT 4h klines from Binance by time range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/binance/market-data/klines?symbol=BTCUSDT&interval=4h&startTime=2026-05-01T00:00:00Z&endTime=2026-05-05T00:00:00Z&limit=10


### Get ETHUSDT 1h klines from Binance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/binance/market-data/klines?symbol=ETHUSDT&interval=1h&limit=5


### Invalid symbol test
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/binance/market-data/klines?symbol=INVALIDPAIR&interval=4h&limit=5


### Invalid limit test
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/binance/market-data/klines?symbol=BTCUSDT&interval=4h&limit=2000